Napakakiller headline.

137
00:16:35.577 --> 00:16:36.787
Hindi iyon ang punto.

138
00:16:36.870 --> 00:16:41.041
Ako naman ang umamin this time.

139
00:16:41.625 --> 00:16:42.459
