160
00:17:48.859 --> 00:17:50.027
Tingnan natin.

161
00:17:50.110 --> 00:17:52.404
buhay panlipunan…
Hindi na mahalaga ngayon.

162
00:17:52.488 --> 00:17:53.655
At mahalaga ang buhay pag-ibig.

163
00:17:53.739 --> 00:17:57.076
Dahil sa mga kaganapan kamakailan,
baka layaw ako.

164
00:17:58.786 --> 00:17:59.787
{\an8}"Ermitanyo"?

165
00:18:00.621 --> 00:18:01.497
Mali ito.

166
