at bagong simula.

200
00:20:04.411 --> 00:20:07.998
"Ang wakas at isang bagong simula"?

201
00:20:16.298 --> 00:20:17.507
Napakasarap?

202
00:20:17.591 --> 00:20:18.926
Kailangan kong kumain ng maayos

203
00:20:19.009 --> 00:20:21.178
