At higit pa.

484
00:42:31.173 --> 00:42:32.299
halik!

485
00:42:33.676 --> 00:42:35.302
Ito ay personal.

486
00:42:35.386 --> 00:42:37.638
Balita ko pinakasalan mo siya
alang-alang sa mana.

487
00:42:37.721 --> 00:42:39.306
Ang isang halik ay hindi isang problema.

488
00:42:41.058 --> 00:42:42.351
Kailangan ba talaga?

489
00:42:44.270 --> 00:42:46.855
"Susuko ang Partido A at B

490
00:42:46.939 --> 00:42:48.983
