491
00:42:50.943 --> 00:42:51.777
ok

492
00:42:52.861 --> 00:42:53.696
eto para sayo

493
00:43:48.167 --> 00:43:49.376
Oras para sa isang larawan sa isang pagkakataon.

494
00:43:50.669 --> 00:43:51.962
Magsimula tayo sa lalaking ikakasal.

495
00:44:07.144 --> 00:44:08.270
Sok Hune.

496
00:44:13.942 --> 00:44:15.611
Mukhang hindi ako naging magaling.

497
00:44:16.528 --> 00:44:17.363
Hindi naman.

498
00:44:18.405 --> 00:44:19.698
Ikaw lang ang perpekto.

499
00:44:23.744 --> 00:44:25.120
para sa akin

500
00:44:26.747 --> 00:44:29.458
palagi kang magiging pamilya
na aking maaasahan.

501
00:44:30.959 --> 00:44:33.837
Lagi akong nasa tabi mo, To Hee.

502
00:44:35.506 --> 00:44:36.840
salamat po.

503
00:44:44.848 --> 00:44:47.643
Kahit na si Mr. Jeong ay pare-parehong bastos sa lahat,

504
