520
00:46:27.451 --> 00:46:29.203
- At matagal na ba siyang ganito?
- Well...

521
00:46:35.042 --> 00:46:37.044
Star Chin, sasabihin ko sana sa iyo

522
00:46:37.127 --> 00:46:39.796
